{"change_summary":"Resolved the pending remediation items by documenting why `coarse_porous.toml` keeps a `colonizable_area_factor` valid-range ceiling above 1.0, adding an explicit 25°C `pKa1` reference value to `docs/PROVENANCE_STATUS.md`, and attaching provenance/confidence metadata to the previously uncovered shrimp condition, molt-stress, and NH3-stress tunables in `neocaridina_davidi.toml` including the now-present `temp_condition_min_factor`. Extended `tank_data` regression coverage so the porous-media note and expanded shrimp metadata set remain locked in.","outstanding_risks":["`soft_acidic.toml` and `ro_like.toml` still do not carry per-parameter `param_meta` entries.","Substrate provenance coverage is still partial beyond representative `colonizable_area_factor` annotations; other substrate indices and nutrient-charge fields remain unannotated.","Code-resident carbonate solver constants still rely on doc comments plus `docs/PROVENANCE_STATUS.md` until the project adds a dedicated metadata registry for shared chemistry constants."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the pending amendments, current provenance summary, and shrimp/substrate preset metadata to confirm the exact gaps and verify the related runtime knobs already present in the tree.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated `crates/tank_data/data/substrate/coarse_porous.toml` and `crates/tank_data/data/shrimp/neocaridina_davidi.toml` to add the missing explanatory note and per-parameter provenance/confidence metadata for the shrimp condition, molt-stress, and NH3 tunables.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Revised `docs/PROVENANCE_STATUS.md` so the carbonate solver table includes a 25°C `pKa1` reference and the developer-facing shrimp/substrate summary reflects the newly annotated tunables and porous-media interpretation.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Strengthened `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` regression coverage for the porous-media note and the expanded shrimp metadata set, then ran formatting and package tests.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_data` passed with 38 tests green and 0 failures.","Regression coverage passed for `presets::tests::shipped_substrate_presets_expose_colonizable_area_metadata`, `presets::tests::shipped_shrimp_priority_metadata_covers_repro_suppression_curve_endpoints`, and `presets::tests::shipped_shrimp_condition_and_nh3_tunables_have_provenance_metadata`."]}